{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "New statutory standards for staff and fees in the care industry",
        "additional_details": "There needs to be a law regarding care & nursing homes to ensure the safety of residents to:\r\n- have a minimum staff to resident ratio\r\n- mandate transparency & full breakdown of care fee calculation to be provided when required\r\n- ensure care fees should be the same regardless of who pays the fees. Those self-funding currently pay more than council funded residents to balance the books.\r\n- require a good command of the English language to ensure better communication with people being supported",
        "background": "We want the Government to set new statutory minimum standards for staff and fees in the care industry to ensure a safer industry for clients.",
